cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PlotlyVizPro in research, please cite it as below."
title: "PlotlyVizPro: a research-grade toolkit for interactive, publication-ready Plotly figures"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Praveen
    given-names: Satvik
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-27
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: https://github.com/SatvikPraveen/PlotlyVizPro
url: https://satvikpraveen.github.io/PlotlyVizPro/
keywords:
  - visualization
  - plotly
  - statistics
  - accessibility
  - reproducibility
abstract: >-
  PlotlyVizPro packages statistical overlays (OLS with confidence and prediction
  bands, robust LOWESS, bootstrap intervals, anomaly detectors, seasonal
  decomposition), colour-vision-deficiency-safe palette auditing, shape-preserving
  downsampling (LTTB, MinMax, M4) and provenance-tracked export into a typed,
  tested Python library built on Plotly.
